# Project Context

This is a Next.js project using App Router. Exact dependency versions are defined in `package.json` — refer to it when you need specific version information.

## Stack

- **Framework**: Next.js with App Router and Turbopack
- **UI Library**: React with React Compiler enabled
- **Language**: TypeScript (strict mode)
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 (CSS-first configuration)
- **Components**: shadcn/ui built on Base UI
- **Icons**: HugeIcons
- **Validation**: Zod
- **i18n**: next-intl
- **PWA**: Serwist
